This product includes software and data developed as part of a personal
research project on the training stability of long-horizon, multi-tool
agentic reinforcement learning.

================================================================================
Third-party benchmark: τ-bench
================================================================================

The agent environment, tool definitions, task set and reward/evaluation
protocol are adapted from τ-bench:

    Copyright (c) 2024 Sierra
    MIT License — https://github.com/sierra-research/tau-bench

Redistributed τ-bench-derived material in this repository:

  data/sft_seed.jsonl
  data/sft_final.jsonl     Agent trajectories taken from τ-bench's published
                           historical_trajectories (the τ-bench authors
                           generated these with gpt-4o and Claude; each record
                           keeps its `source` field). Replayed and re-rendered
                           by scripts/build_sft_data.py + scripts/synth_sft_data.py.

  data/tasks_expanded.json Programmatically expanded tasks, derived from the
                           τ-bench airline task/user records by
                           scripts/expand_tasks.py.

  data/user_slots.json     User-simulator slot table, derived from the τ-bench
                           airline user records by scripts/build_user_slots.py.

The τ-bench source tree itself is NOT vendored here. scripts/env.sh resolves it
at runtime through a four-level fallback (env var / sibling directory / vendor
directory / original layout) — see scripts/env.sh and docs/.

