================================================================================
Reference implementation — NOT redistributed
================================================================================

This project's research question is positioned against the published findings
of "agentic-grpo-longhorizon" (long-horizon multi-tool agentic RL, including
the LATA length-normalisation scheme). That repository was used READ-ONLY as a
local reference for comparison; it carries no license file, and none of its
source or data is included in this repository.
